{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":1,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The vision of Isaiah the son of Amoz, which he saw concerning Judah and Jerusalem in the days of Uzziah, Jotham, Ahaz, and Hezekiah, the kings of Judah:","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"vision","s":["H2377"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Isaiah","s":["H3470"],"a":[1]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"son","s":["H1121"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Amoz","s":["H0531"],"a":[3]},{"t":", which he "},{"t":"saw","s":["H2372"],"a":[5]},{"t":" concerning "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[7]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Jerusalem","s":["H3389"],"a":[8]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"days","s":["H3117"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Uzziah","s":["H5818"],"a":[10]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Jotham","s":["H3147"],"a":[11]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Ahaz","s":["H0271"],"a":[12]},{"t":", and "},{"t":"Hezekiah","s":["H3169"]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"kings","s":["H4428"],"a":[14]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Judah","s":["H3063"],"a":[15]},{"t":":"}]},{"n":2,"text":"Hear, O heavens, and hearken, O earth, For Jehovah has spoken: I have brought up children, and I have raised them; And yet they have rebelled against Me.","tok":[{"t":"Hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":", O "},{"t":"heavens","s":["H8064"],"a":[1]},{"t":", and hearken, O "},{"t":"earth","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":", For "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[6]},{"t":": I have brought "},{"t":"up","s":["H7311"],"a":[9]},{"t":" "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[7]},{"t":", and I have raised them; And yet they have "},{"t":"rebelled","s":["H6586"],"a":[11]},{"t":" against Me."}]},{"n":3,"text":"The ox knows his owner, And the donkey, his master’s manger; But Israel does not know, My people do not much consider.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"ox","s":["H7794"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"knows","s":["H3045"],"a":[0]},{"t":" his "},{"t":"owner","s":["H7069"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And the donkey, his "},{"t":"master’s","s":["H1167"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"manger","s":["H0018"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; But "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":" does not "},{"t":"know","s":["H3045"],"a":[8]},{"t":", My "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[9]},{"t":" do not much "},{"t":"consider","s":["H0995"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Alas, sinful nation, A people heavy with iniquity, Seed of evildoers, Children acting corruptly! They have forsaken Jehovah; They have despised the Holy One of Israel; They have become estranged and have gone backward.","tok":[{"t":"Alas","s":["H1945"],"a":[0]},{"t":", "},{"t":"sinful","s":["H2398"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"nation","s":["H1471"],"a":[1]},{"t":", A "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"heavy","s":["H3515"],"a":[4]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H5771"],"a":[5]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Seed","s":["H2233"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"evildoers","s":["H7489"],"a":[7]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Children","s":["H1121"],"a":[8]},{"t":" acting corruptly! They have "},{"t":"forsaken","s":["H5800"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[12]},{"t":"; They have despised the Holy "},{"t":"One","s":["H6918"],"a":[15]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[16]},{"t":"; They have become estranged and have gone "},{"t":"backward","s":["H0268"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"Where will you be stricken again? Will you continue your apostasy? The whole head has become sick, And the whole heart faint;","tok":[{"t":"Where will you be "},{"t":"stricken","s":["H5221"],"a":[2]},{"t":" again? Will you continue your apostasy? The whole "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[7]},{"t":" has become "},{"t":"sick","s":["H2483"],"a":[8]},{"t":", And the whole "},{"t":"heart","s":["H3824"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"faint","s":["H1742"],"a":[11]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":6,"text":"From the sole of the foot even to the head, There is no soundness in it, Only bruises and blows And raw wounds — They have not been pressed out nor bound up Nor softened with oil.","tok":[{"t":"From the "},{"t":"sole","s":["H3709"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"foot","s":["H7272"],"a":[1]},{"t":" even to the "},{"t":"head","s":["H7218"],"a":[3]},{"t":", There is no "},{"t":"soundness","s":["H4974"],"a":[6]},{"t":" in it, "},{"t":"Only","s":["H6482"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"bruises","s":["H2250"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and blows And raw "},{"t":"wounds","s":["H6482"],"a":[7]},{"t":" — They have not been pressed out nor bound "},{"t":"up","s":["H2280"],"a":[14]},{"t":" Nor softened with oil."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Your land is a desolation; Your cities are burned with fire; Your field — in your sight Strangers devour it; It is a desolation, like something overthrown by strangers.","tok":[{"t":"Your "},{"t":"land","s":["H0127"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is a desolation; Your "},{"t":"cities","s":["H5892"],"a":[2]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"burned","s":["H8313"],"a":[3]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"fire","s":["H0784"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Your field — in your sight "},{"t":"Strangers","s":["H2114"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"devour","s":["H0398"],"a":[8]},{"t":" it; It is a desolation, like something "},{"t":"overthrown","s":["H4114"],"a":[11]},{"t":" by "},{"t":"strangers","s":["H2114"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"And the daughter of Zion is left Like a booth in a vineyard, Like a hut in a cucumber field, Like a besieged city.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[2]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"left","s":["H3498"],"a":[0]},{"t":" Like a booth in a "},{"t":"vineyard","s":["H3754"],"a":[4]},{"t":", Like a hut in a "},{"t":"cucumber","s":["H4750"],"a":[6]},{"t":" field, Like a "},{"t":"besieged","s":["H5341"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Unless Jehovah of hosts Had left to us a surviving few, We would have been like Sodom, We would have resembled Gomorrah.","tok":[{"t":"Unless","s":["H3884"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[2]},{"t":" Had "},{"t":"left","s":["H3498"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to us a surviving few, We would have "},{"t":"been","s":["H1961"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"like","s":["H1819"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[7]},{"t":", We would have resembled "},{"t":"Gomorrah","s":["H6017"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Hear the word of Jehovah, You rulers of Sodom; Hearken to the instruction of our God, You people of Gomorrah.","tok":[{"t":"Hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":", You "},{"t":"rulers","s":["H7101"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sodom","s":["H5467"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; Hearken to the instruction of our "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[7]},{"t":", You "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Gomorrah","s":["H6017"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"What is the multitude of your sacrifices to Me? Says Jehovah. I have had My fill of burnt offerings of rams And the fat of fed cattle; The blood of bulls and lambs And goats, I do not delight in.","tok":[{"t":"What","s":["H4100"],"a":[0]},{"t":" is the "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H7230"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of your "},{"t":"sacrifices","s":["H2077"],"a":[3]},{"t":" to Me? "},{"t":"Says","s":["H0559"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":". I have had My fill of burnt "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H5930"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"rams","s":["H0352"],"a":[8]},{"t":" And the "},{"t":"fat","s":["H2459"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of fed cattle; The "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"bulls","s":["H6499"],"a":[12]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"lambs","s":["H3532"],"a":[13]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"goats","s":["H6260"],"a":[14]},{"t":", I do not "},{"t":"delight","s":["H2654"],"a":[16]},{"t":" in."}]},{"n":12,"text":"When you come to appear before Me, Who has required this of your hand, To trample My courts?","tok":[{"t":"When you "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[1]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"appear","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"before","s":["H6440"],"a":[3]},{"t":" Me, Who has "},{"t":"required","s":["H1245"],"a":[5]},{"t":" this of your "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[7]},{"t":", To trample My "},{"t":"courts","s":["H2691"],"a":[9]},{"t":"?"}]},{"n":13,"text":"Bring no more vain offerings; Incense is an abomination to Me. New moon and Sabbath, the calling of convocations — I cannot bear iniquity and the solemn assembly.","tok":[{"t":"Bring","s":["H0935"],"a":[2]},{"t":" no "},{"t":"more","s":["H3254"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"vain","s":["H7723"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"offerings","s":["H4503"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Incense","s":["H7004"],"a":[5]},{"t":" is an "},{"t":"abomination","s":["H8441"],"a":[6]},{"t":" to Me. New "},{"t":"moon","s":["H2320"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Sabbath","s":["H7676"],"a":[10]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"calling","s":["H7121"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of convocations — I cannot bear "},{"t":"iniquity","s":["H0205"],"a":[15]},{"t":" and the solemn assembly."}]},{"n":14,"text":"Your new moons and your appointed feasts My soul hates; They have become a burden on Me; I am weary of bearing them.","tok":[{"t":"Your new "},{"t":"moons","s":["H2320"],"a":[0]},{"t":" and your appointed "},{"t":"feasts","s":["H4150"],"a":[1]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"soul","s":["H5315"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"hates","s":["H8130"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; They have become a burden on Me; I am "},{"t":"weary","s":["H3811"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"bearing","s":["H5375"],"a":[8]},{"t":" them."}]},{"n":15,"text":"Thus, when you spread forth your hands, I will hide My eyes from you; Even though you multiply your prayers, I will not hear. Your hands are full of blood;","tok":[{"t":"Thus, when you spread "},{"t":"forth","s":["H6566"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3709"],"a":[1]},{"t":", I will "},{"t":"hide","s":["H5956"],"a":[2]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[3]},{"t":" from you; Even though you multiply your "},{"t":"prayers","s":["H8605"],"a":[8]},{"t":", I will not "},{"t":"hear","s":["H8085"],"a":[10]},{"t":". Your "},{"t":"hands","s":["H3027"],"a":[11]},{"t":" are "},{"t":"full","s":["H4390"],"a":[13]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"blood","s":["H1818"],"a":[12]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":16,"text":"Wash yourselves; cleanse yourselves. Turn away the evil of your deeds From before My eyes. Cease doing what is evil;","tok":[{"t":"Wash","s":["H7364"],"a":[0]},{"t":" yourselves; cleanse yourselves. Turn "},{"t":"away","s":["H5493"],"a":[2]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7455"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of your deeds From "},{"t":"before","s":["H5048"],"a":[5]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"eyes","s":["H5869"],"a":[6]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Cease","s":["H2308"],"a":[7]},{"t":" "},{"t":"doing","s":["H4611"],"a":[4]},{"t":" what is "},{"t":"evil","s":["H7489"],"a":[8]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":17,"text":"Learn to do good. Seek justice; Correct the ruthless. Defend the orphan; Plead for the widow.","tok":[{"t":"Learn","s":["H3925"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to do good. "},{"t":"Seek","s":["H1875"],"a":[2]},{"t":" justice; Correct the ruthless. Defend the orphan; "},{"t":"Plead","s":["H7378"],"a":[8]},{"t":" for the "},{"t":"widow","s":["H0490"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Come now and let us reason together, Says Jehovah. Though your sins are like scarlet, They will be as white as snow; Though they are as red as crimson, They will be like wool.","tok":[{"t":"Come "},{"t":"now","s":["H3212"]},{"t":" and let us reason "},{"t":"together","s":["H3198"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Says","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":". Though your "},{"t":"sins","s":["H2399"],"a":[7]},{"t":" are like "},{"t":"scarlet","s":["H8144"],"a":[8]},{"t":", They will be as "},{"t":"white","s":["H3835"],"a":[10]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"snow","s":["H7950"],"a":[9]},{"t":"; Though they are as "},{"t":"red","s":["H0119"],"a":[12]},{"t":" as "},{"t":"crimson","s":["H8438"],"a":[13]},{"t":", They will be like "},{"t":"wool","s":["H6785"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":19,"text":"If you are willing and listen, You will eat the good of the land;","tok":[{"t":"If you are "},{"t":"willing","s":["H0014"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and listen, You will "},{"t":"eat","s":["H0398"],"a":[5]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"good","s":["H2898"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[4]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":20,"text":"But if you refuse and rebel, You will be devoured by the sword; For the mouth of Jehovah has spoken.","tok":[{"t":"But if you "},{"t":"refuse","s":["H3985"],"a":[1]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"rebel","s":["H4784"],"a":[2]},{"t":", You will be "},{"t":"devoured","s":["H0398"],"a":[4]},{"t":" by the "},{"t":"sword","s":["H2719"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; For the "},{"t":"mouth","s":["H6310"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[7]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":21,"text":"How the faithful city Has become a harlot! She who was full of justice, She in whom righteousness once lodged, But now murderers!","tok":[{"t":"How the "},{"t":"faithful","s":["H0539"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H7151"],"a":[3]},{"t":" Has become a "},{"t":"harlot","s":["H2181"],"a":[2]},{"t":"! She who was "},{"t":"full","s":["H4392"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of justice, She in whom "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[7]},{"t":" once "},{"t":"lodged","s":["H3885"],"a":[8]},{"t":", But now "},{"t":"murderers","s":["H7523"],"a":[11]},{"t":"!"}]},{"n":22,"text":"Your silver has become dross; Your wine diluted with water;","tok":[{"t":"Your "},{"t":"silver","s":["H3701"],"a":[0]},{"t":" has become "},{"t":"dross","s":["H5509"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; Your "},{"t":"wine","s":["H5435"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"diluted","s":["H4107"],"a":[4]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[5]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":23,"text":"Your rulers are rebellious And companions of thieves; They all love bribes And chase after rewards; They do not defend the orphan, Nor does the widow’s plea come before them.","tok":[{"t":"Your rulers are "},{"t":"rebellious","s":["H5637"],"a":[1]},{"t":" And "},{"t":"companions","s":["H2270"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"thieves","s":["H1590"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They all "},{"t":"love","s":["H0157"],"a":[5]},{"t":" bribes And chase after "},{"t":"rewards","s":["H8021"],"a":[8]},{"t":"; They do not defend the orphan, Nor does the widow’s plea "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[15]},{"t":" before them."}]},{"n":24,"text":"Hence, the Lord Jehovah of hosts, The Mighty One of Israel, declares: Ah, I will ease Myself of My adversaries, And I will avenge Myself of My enemies;","tok":[{"t":"Hence","s":["H5002"],"a":[1]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"Lord","s":["H0113"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[3]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"hosts","s":["H6635"],"a":[4]},{"t":", The Mighty "},{"t":"One","s":["H0046"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[6]},{"t":", declares: "},{"t":"Ah","s":["H1945"],"a":[7]},{"t":", I will "},{"t":"ease","s":["H5162"],"a":[8]},{"t":" Myself of My "},{"t":"adversaries","s":["H6862"],"a":[9]},{"t":", And I will "},{"t":"avenge","s":["H5358"],"a":[10]},{"t":" Myself of My "},{"t":"enemies","s":["H0341"],"a":[11]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":25,"text":"And I will turn My hand against you. I will thoroughly purge away your dross as with lye, And I will remove all your alloy.","tok":[{"t":"And I will "},{"t":"turn","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" My "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" against you. I will thoroughly purge "},{"t":"away","s":["H6884"],"a":[3]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"dross","s":["H5509"],"a":[5]},{"t":" as with lye, And I will remove all your alloy."}]},{"n":26,"text":"And I will restore your judges as at the first And your counselors as at the beginning. Afterward you will be called the city of righteousness, The faithful city.","tok":[{"t":"And I will "},{"t":"restore","s":["H7725"],"a":[0]},{"t":" your "},{"t":"judges","s":["H8199"],"a":[1]},{"t":" as at the "},{"t":"first","s":["H7223"],"a":[2]},{"t":" And your counselors as at the "},{"t":"beginning","s":["H8462"],"a":[4]},{"t":". "},{"t":"Afterward","s":["H0310"],"a":[5]},{"t":" you will be "},{"t":"called","s":["H7121"],"a":[7]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"city","s":["H5892"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[10]},{"t":", The "},{"t":"faithful","s":["H0539"],"a":[12]},{"t":" "},{"t":"city","s":["H7151"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":27,"text":"Zion will be ransomed with justice, And her returning ones with righteousness.","tok":[{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[0]},{"t":" will be ransomed with justice, And her returning ones with "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6666"],"a":[4]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":28,"text":"And there will be the shattering of rebels and sinners together, And those who forsake Jehovah will meet their end.","tok":[{"t":"And there will be the shattering of rebels and "},{"t":"sinners","s":["H2400"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[3]},{"t":", And those who "},{"t":"forsake","s":["H5800"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[5]},{"t":" will meet their end."}]},{"n":29,"text":"For you will be ashamed of the terebinths That you have taken pleasure in; And you will be embarrassed at the gardens That you have chosen.","tok":[{"t":"For you will be "},{"t":"ashamed","s":["H0954"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of the terebinths That you have taken pleasure in; And you will be embarrassed at the "},{"t":"gardens","s":["H1593"],"a":[6]},{"t":" That you have "},{"t":"chosen","s":["H0977"],"a":[8]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":30,"text":"For you will be like a terebinth Whose leaves are falling, And like a garden In which there is no water;","tok":[{"t":"For you will be like a terebinth Whose leaves are falling, And like a "},{"t":"garden","s":["H1593"],"a":[5]},{"t":" In which there is no "},{"t":"water","s":["H4325"],"a":[7]},{"t":";"}]},{"n":31,"text":"And the strong man will become tow, And his work a spark; And they will both burn together, And there will be none to extinguish them.","tok":[{"t":"And the "},{"t":"strong","s":["H2634"],"a":[1]},{"t":" man will become "},{"t":"tow","s":["H5296"],"a":[2]},{"t":", And his work a "},{"t":"spark","s":["H5213"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; And they will "},{"t":"both","s":["H8147"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"burn","s":["H1197"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"together","s":["H3162"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And there will be none to extinguish them."}]}]}
